# Optional backend-runtime-v1 release archives for local/CI image bake.
# Most product tarballs stay gitignored (never commit secrets here).
# lp-na7d: live pin needs one real lanyard-agent tarball baked into the
# agent-gateway image so cold create is not a fake-gateway stub. Allow only
# the mailbox-era tarball (lanyard-agent origin/main 8835654 / lac-r9w).
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
!lanyard-agent-0.0.0-main.8835654f4ecd.tar.gz
!lanyard-agent-0.0.0-main.8835654f4ecd.tar.gz.sha256
